  "content": "<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>本模组引入了来自Goety的食物（包括方块食物）与饮品，以及使用Goety材料制作的刀具和由Goety资源打造的新型烹饪器具。在探索奥秘法术的同时，用美食佳肴来增强你的黑暗魔法修行！<br><br></p>\n<p>如果您发现描述中存在任何其他问题，请务必告知我们。</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1363736/description_106e0fd5-e7e0-4a07-b414-b6e188701dda.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"655\" height=\"451\"></div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_d4c9c18d-f11f-4866-ab4a-eb82ab066c85.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"719\" height=\"681\"></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;</div>",
